  "$Comment": "Elsie the Weaver's look, every piece of it the game's own: the player's body and face with her hair up in a copper bun, the character creator's villager shirt under its farmer's dress, plain brown trousers and buckled shoes. Parent Seasons_Of_Orbis_Villager brings the player's body, its animations and its hitbox, as Parent Player does for the temple's own Mithril Guard, and the wave she greets a player with. The body, face, mouth and ears share one skin tone (GradientSet Skin, GradientId 03): change all four together. DefaultAttachments replaces the parent's list whole, so the face pieces come first. The character creator draws the Bun over a generic short cut (its RequiresGenericHaircut), so both are here in one colour. A greyscale texture takes its colour from GradientSet and GradientId, the dyes the character creator offers players: change a GradientId to re-dye one piece.",
